cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Basal Ganglia Digital Twin
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: BG Digital Twin contributors
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/huhugyto177-hub/bg-digital-twin
url: https://bg-digital-twin-landing.vercel.app
abstract: >-
  Preclinical mean-field simulator of a cortico-basal ganglia-thalamic
  circuit. It maps a user-specified target, mechanism, and exposure envelope
  to dimensionless circuit proxies. It does not predict binding, blood-brain
  barrier penetration, ADMET, toxicity, or clinical efficacy.
keywords:
  - basal ganglia
  - computational neuroscience
  - preclinical
  - digital twin
